---
description: PHP library rules (no Symfony dependency)
globs:
  - "src/**/*.php"
alwaysApply: false
---

Target the declared range by default: PHP >=8.2 <8.6. This library has no Symfony dependency; do not add one.

Prefer:
- modern PHP with strict typing and explicit return types
- PSR-12 coding style
- final (and readonly where possible) classes
- small focused classes; no static or cross-request state (FrankenPHP worker mode, kernel reset off)
- preserving public API: every public class and method is a contract for independently released packages
- PHPDoc in English for non-trivial classes, methods, and complex behavior

Do not introduce BC breaks unless explicitly requested.
Do not add PHPDoc in Spanish.
Do not touch unrelated namespaces or files.
